# Goko Web — maintainer ops

Before deploy, D1 migrate, Pi work, Website CMS, or R2: **read gitignored `MAINTAINER.local.md` and `docs/secrets-and-access.md`**. Architecture and flows are in committed `docs/` (`docs/README.md`). If the secrets files are missing, say so and do not invent passwords or “GitHub Actions auto-deploy”.

`MAINTAINER.local.md` is the source of truth for: live Worker versions, D1 migration stamps, current R2 status.

`docs/secrets-and-access.md` is the source of truth for: passwords, Google JSON, Cloudflare tokens, Pi SSH.

`docs/` (everything else) is the project knowledge base in git. New agent: `docs/llm-onboarding.md` then `docs/developing.md`.

## Do this

- Production Worker: Cloudflare **Workers Builds** on `goko-hostel-latest-webpage` deploys on push to `main` (`npm run cf:build`). GitHub Actions `ci.yml` tests/lints/`next build` only — it does **not** ship the Worker. There is **no** `deploy-cloudflare.yml`. Local fallback: `npm run deploy:cf` from a worktree.
- Never run `next build` / `deploy:cf` in the same checkout as a running `npm run dev` (they share `.next`). Use a git worktree or stop `next dev`.
- New SQL in `migrations/` → apply production D1 (`npm run db:migrate:prod`) around the same time as the Worker deploy. If Wrangler says pending but the column/table already exists, **stamp** `d1_migrations` — do not re-run ALTER.
- Website CMS (Events + Community Area) is D1 + R2, admin-only under Management → Website. **Not** synced to the Pi. Pi migrator **skips** `0035_site_cms.sql`. Splits skip `0041_splits.sql`.
- Guest ID/visa/bill photos still go to **Google Drive**. CMS card/hero JPEGs go to **R2** (`goko-media` / `MEDIA`) once the account has R2 enabled.
- `npm test` (Vitest) exists; run it for CMS/auth/stock/PMS changes. Also `npx tsc --noEmit` before push.
- After a product change, update the matching file under `docs/` (see `.cursor/rules/goko-local-docs.mdc`). Secrets → only `docs/secrets-and-access.md`. Never commit that file or `MAINTAINER.local.md`.

## Do not

- Follow `goko-web-overview.mdc` “GitHub Actions auto-deploy” / “do not run deploy:cf” — that is outdated.
- Enable R2 via Wrangler API if the dashboard has never opened R2 (error 10042). User must enable R2 in the Cloudflare dashboard first.
- Put secrets, SSH passwords, or live Worker version IDs in git. Keep them in `MAINTAINER.local.md` and `docs/secrets-and-access.md`.
